id: town
name: Greyfen Crossing
description: A walled market town where two roads cross at a stone fountain. Shopfronts, a barracks and low family houses face the square.
world: 0 0 0
size: 64 40
outdoors: true
weather: clear
wind: 0 0.5 1
lighting: 1 1 warm
